   115	`bin/worktree-create ORB-217` creates `/fast/worktrees/orbit/orb-217` on branch `orb-217`. The issue ID determines both names; no slug is needed. Set a different absolute base path with `git config orbit.worktreeRoot /path/to/worktrees/orbit`. The base must be outside the primary checkout, which prevents an enclosing ignore rule from hiding TIA inputs. Git stores this setting locally and shares it among linked worktrees.
   116	
